.TH HSYNC-SERVER 1 "2026-09-29" "hsync-server 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hsync-server \- HSYNC file synchronization server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hsync-server
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hsync-server
is the central HTTP/WebSocket server of the HSYNC sync network. It manages
buckets (shared directories), member accounts and per-account tokens, serves
file upload/download with delta transfer, and pushes live events to connected
clients over WebSocket.
.PP
Configuration is read from environment variables (prefix
.BR HSYNC_ ),
typically supplied through
.BR /etc/hsync-server/hsync-server.conf
by the packaged systemd unit.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-port " " PORT
Listen on PORT (default 9753).
.TP
.BR \-\-ssl
Enable HTTPS/WSS.
.TP
.BR \-\-ssl-cert " " PATH
Path to the TLS certificate file.
.TP
.BR \-\-ssl-key " " PATH
Path to the TLS private key file.
.TP
.BR \-\-env-file " " PATH
Load environment variables from PATH (one KEY=VALUE per line).
.TP
.BR \-\-log-level " " LEVEL
Log level: debug, info, warning, error, critical (default info).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B HSYNC_ADMIN_KEY
Bootstrap admin secret (64 hex characters, optional).
.TP
.B HSYNC_BUCKETS
Path to the buckets directory.
.TP
.B HSYNC_STATE_DIR
Path to the per-bucket state DB directory.
.TP
.B HSYNC_SSL_CERT_DIR
Path to the TLS identity directory.
.TP
.B HSYNC_LOG_FILE
Path to the optional log file.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/hsync-server/hsync-server.conf
Package configuration (EnvironmentFile), owned root:root (0600).
.TP
.I /var/lib/hsync-server
Buckets, state and TLS identity.
.TP
.I /var/log/hsync-server
Service logs.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemd.unit (5)
